Package: libacars2
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: decoding library for ACARS, ADS-B and other AV protocols
 libacars is a library that implements decoding of various aviation
 communication protocols: ACARS, ADS-B, CPDLC, MIAM, X.25 and others.
 .
 This package contains the libacars-2 shared library.

Package: libacars2-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libacars2 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for libacars
 libacars is a library that implements decoding of various aviation
 communication protocols: ACARS, ADS-B, CPDLC, MIAM, X.25 and others.
 .
 This package contains the header files, the pkg-config file
 (libacars-2.pc) and the linker symlink needed to build programs
 against libacars-2.

Package: libacars2-tools
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: command-line tools from the libacars project
 libacars is a library that implements decoding of various aviation
 communication protocols: ACARS, ADS-B, CPDLC, MIAM, X.25 and others.
 .
 This package contains the example/utility programs shipped with
 libacars (e.g. decode_acars_apps, decode_arinc622_apps).
